# Prose is written to be read in a diff, and a formatter that reflows a
# paragraph turns a one-word change into a rewritten page. Markdown and the
# hand-written HTML pages are formatted by whoever edits them.
*.md
public/*.html

# The manifests are GENERATED by scripts/build-manifests.mjs, and
# test/manifest.test.ts fails when a committed one stops matching its source.
# Prettier collapses the short arrays in the JSON manifests, so with both tools
# owning the file the two gates disagree and `npm run manifests` followed by
# `npm run format` leaves the suite red either way round. One owner per file,
# and the generator is it.
manifest*.json
